[02:04.73] Ay imawlan εzizen
[02:08.03] Di tafat mi ara n-beddeɣ
[02:10.12] Xas temcakktem ur wehmeɣ
[02:12.53] Mačči d udem iss i ṛuḥeɣ
[02:14.53] Ara d-mlilent wallen-nwen
[02:18.15] Ara d-mlilent wallen-nwen
